  "helpFaq1Q": "How are payments processed?",
  "helpFaq1A": "We charge directly in the app via Mercado Pago. We accept credit, debit and prepaid cards (Visa, Mastercard, and American Express). Your card is never stored in Atrio: it's only tokenized for the charge.",
  "helpFaq2Q": "When does the host get paid?",
  "helpFaq2A": "The host receives the amount in their Atrio balance once your booking is confirmed. They can withdraw the money to their bank account from the Dashboard.",
  "helpFaq3Q": "Can I cancel a booking?",
  "helpFaq3A": "Yes. Each host sets their own policy (flexible, moderate, or strict). The details appear on the listing screen before paying and later in \"My Bookings\".",
  "helpFaq4Q": "My payment was rejected, what do I do?",
  "helpFaq4A": "In 90% of cases it's the card. Try another card, check the cardholder ID is correct, and that your bank hasn't blocked the transaction. If the problem persists, write to us.",
  "helpFaq5Q": "Why do I need to verify my identity?",
  "helpFaq5A": "Verification increases trust with hosts and guests. Verified users are featured in search results and usually get instant approval on bookings.",
  "helpFaq6Q": "How long does ID verification take?",
  "helpFaq6A": "Between 24 and 48 business hours. When it's ready we'll notify you by email.",
  "helpFaq7Q": "Can I change my email?",
  "helpFaq7A": "Not yet. If you need to migrate to another email, write to us and we'll help.",
  "helpFaq8Q": "I want to delete my account",
  "helpFaq8A": "Go to Settings → Account → Delete account. Note that you won't be able to recover your past bookings or chat history.",

